# AGENTS.md

Context for AI coding agents working in this repository.

## Project

{{ project_name }} — a Flask application generated by [flint](https://github.com/abdulazeezoj/spindle).

## Setup

```
uv sync
```

## Run

```
uv run flask --app src/{{ package_name }}/main run
```

## Test

```
uv run pytest
```

## Layout

- `src/{{ package_name }}/main.py` — the Flask app (`app`) and its routes.
- `tests/` — pytest tests; use `app.test_client()` against
  `{{ package_name }}.main.app`.
{% if config %}
- `src/{{ package_name }}/core/config.py` — `Settings` (`pydantic-settings`),
  loaded from `.env`. Add new config fields there, not as scattered
  `os.environ` reads. `core/` is where shared infrastructure lives —
  config now, and anything else every route might depend on later.
{% endif %}

## Conventions

- Dependencies are managed with `uv` via `pyproject.toml` — don't hand-edit
  `uv.lock`; run `uv add <package>` / `uv remove <package>` instead.
- Keep route handlers typed; return plain dicts, which Flask auto-serializes
  to JSON.

